WEBVTT

00:00:07.826 --> 00:00:09.161
[Light Fury groans]

00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:12.873
[Hiccup] How are we gonna get him
off her back without hurting her?

00:00:12.956 --> 00:00:15.208
Fear the facial hair!

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:16.460
[groans]

00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:18.712
[gasps]

00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:20.255
[yelling]

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:22.632
[gasping and screaming]

00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:26.470
-[Gobber] Oh, I have missed this.
-Me, too.

00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:28.138
-[grunts]
-[laughing]

00:00:28.221 --> 00:00:29.306
See that there?

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:31.433
Aw, cute.

00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:33.935
That's a bad omen. You're cursed.

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:35.729
-[laughing]
-[gasps]

00:00:35.896 --> 00:00:37.731
[Hobgobblers squealing]

00:00:40.525 --> 00:00:41.943
Yes! Go on!

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.237
Good on you! [chuckles]

00:00:44.321 --> 00:00:46.823
-I guess you're not so bad after all.
-[snarling]

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.325
-[clears throat]
-[gasps]

00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:50.160
[groans woozily]

00:00:53.497 --> 00:00:54.748
[Astrid] Ha!

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.419
[guards screaming]

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:05.884
[rumbling]

00:01:09.346 --> 00:01:10.347
[guard] Abandon ship!

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.140
-[screaming]
-Whoa!

00:01:13.266 --> 00:01:14.309
Ahhh!

00:01:17.062 --> 00:01:18.230
[grunting]

00:01:19.731 --> 00:01:20.816
[Tuffnut] Yay!

00:01:20.899 --> 00:01:21.983
Yeah!

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.276
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:29.866 --> 00:01:32.077
-[dragon roars]
-[Hiccup] Uh, we've got problems.

00:01:40.752 --> 00:01:41.586
[snarls]

00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:43.255
[both roaring]

00:01:46.842 --> 00:01:49.177
[Hoark] Take him down, Hiccup!

00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:51.763
[all cheering]

00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:53.598
[roars]

00:01:55.559 --> 00:01:56.393
[rattles and snaps]

00:01:56.726 --> 00:01:57.936
[grunting]

00:01:58.728 --> 00:02:01.398
We need a better plan, and quick.

00:02:04.609 --> 00:02:05.694
[electricity crackling]

00:02:05.902 --> 00:02:08.029
I got a... Wait! What are you doing?

00:02:08.238 --> 00:02:11.366
-[snarling]
-Okay. Okay.

00:02:11.867 --> 00:02:13.034
[roaring loudly]

00:02:20.417 --> 00:02:21.835
[crowd gasping and murmuring]

00:02:25.672 --> 00:02:27.883
-[electricity crackles]
-[Toothless roars]

00:02:29.342 --> 00:02:30.343
[yells]

00:02:32.053 --> 00:02:33.180
[groans]

00:02:34.389 --> 00:02:35.682
[Grimmel screams]

00:02:35.891 --> 00:02:37.142
[both grunting]

00:02:37.225 --> 00:02:38.685
You'll kill both of us.

00:02:39.477 --> 00:02:41.021
Fighting over a dragon.

00:02:41.188 --> 00:02:42.397
That's your plan?

00:02:42.564 --> 00:02:43.899
[groaning]

00:02:45.775 --> 00:02:46.985
This is.

00:02:48.403 --> 00:02:49.529
[grunts]

00:02:49.738 --> 00:02:50.739
[groans]

00:02:51.364 --> 00:02:52.532
Save him.

00:02:58.246 --> 00:02:59.456
[calling]

00:03:25.315 --> 00:03:26.816
[shrieking]

00:03:29.611 --> 00:03:30.654
[screams]

00:03:30.737 --> 00:03:31.988
No!

00:03:35.867 --> 00:03:37.327
[grunts happily]

00:03:37.786 --> 00:03:40.872
See? I knew you'd come around.

00:03:48.213 --> 00:03:49.047
[grunts softly]

00:03:50.298 --> 00:03:51.758
[dragons calling]

00:03:58.974 --> 00:04:00.642
[all cheering]

00:04:01.768 --> 00:04:02.769
Yeah!

00:04:13.405 --> 00:04:14.406
[grunts]

00:04:17.158 --> 00:04:19.411
Hey. Good morning, bud.

00:04:19.494 --> 00:04:20.912
[groaning softly]

00:04:20.996 --> 00:04:22.080
Here you go.

00:04:23.498 --> 00:04:25.250
Boy, you're full of surprises.

00:04:26.584 --> 00:04:27.711
[cooing]

00:04:28.962 --> 00:04:30.005
He's all yours.

00:04:35.635 --> 00:04:37.262
[Toothless purrs]

00:04:40.432 --> 00:04:41.891
[both chuckle]

00:04:42.058 --> 00:04:44.352
You know, Eret may be blessed with brawn,

00:04:44.436 --> 00:04:47.897
but, just between us, you have the brains.

00:04:48.606 --> 00:04:49.649
Number one.

00:04:59.159 --> 00:05:00.869
[both purring]

00:05:05.582 --> 00:05:07.000
[sniffs softly]

00:05:19.471 --> 00:05:21.056
[grunting sadly]

00:05:22.724 --> 00:05:25.352
You're right, bud. It's time.

00:05:27.187 --> 00:05:31.816
I was so busy
fighting for a world that I wanted,

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:35.028
I didn't think about what you needed.

00:05:38.865 --> 00:05:40.700
You've looked after us for long enough.

00:05:41.868 --> 00:05:43.119
Time to look after yourselves.

00:05:52.629 --> 00:05:53.963
[snorts softly]

00:05:57.592 --> 00:05:59.094
Oh, Stormfly,

00:05:59.677 --> 00:06:00.845
my good girl.

00:06:00.929 --> 00:06:02.180
All right, Grumpy.

00:06:03.264 --> 00:06:04.474
Off you go.

00:06:05.392 --> 00:06:08.353
So long, you big ugly beast.

00:06:08.436 --> 00:06:09.479
I'll miss you.

00:06:18.363 --> 00:06:20.907
Oh, Cloudjumper. Oh.

00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:31.167
Go on, bud.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.837
Lead them to the Hidden World.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.713
[purrs]

00:06:35.964 --> 00:06:37.173
You'll be safe there.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.344
Safer than you could ever be with me.

00:06:41.428 --> 00:06:42.679
[grunts]

00:06:42.762 --> 00:06:45.140
It's okay. I love you, too.

00:06:45.432 --> 00:06:46.599
And I want you to be free.

00:06:46.683 --> 00:06:47.934
[groans softly]

00:06:50.687 --> 00:06:52.355
Our world doesn't deserve you.

00:06:53.273 --> 00:06:54.274
Yet.

00:06:59.612 --> 00:07:01.072
[purring]

00:07:05.952 --> 00:07:06.911
Go, Toothless.

00:07:09.414 --> 00:07:10.415
Go.

00:07:23.511 --> 00:07:26.014
[roaring loudly]

00:07:26.181 --> 00:07:27.891
[dragons roaring]

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.106
[purrs]

00:07:49.996 --> 00:07:51.498
[dragons roaring]

